{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-lancashire-blackburn-with-darwen-and-blackpool","content_id":"82184aff-b330-4caa-bd5b-53da75310b7d","description":"This consultation seeks views on the local government reorganisation proposals we have received from councils in Lancashire, Blackburn with Darwen and Blackpool.​","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9338628","isbn":"","title":"Proposals for local government reorganisation in Lancashire, Blackburn with Darwen and Blackpool","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-lancashire-blackburn-with-darwen-and-blackpool/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-lancashire-blackburn-with-darwen-and-blackpool"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":740576,"filename":"Lancashire__Blackburn_with_Darwen_and_Blackpool_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf","id":"9407377","isbn":"","number_of_pages":53,"title":"Lancashire, Blackburn with Darwen and Blackpool: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f4f8ebc41483a25b676bd/Lancashire__Blackburn_with_Darwen_and_Blackpool_-_Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on the proposals submitted by councils for the reorganisation of local government in Lancashire, Blackburn with Darwen and Blackpool.  </p>\n\n<p>​Responses to this consultation will inform our decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Summary and analys